Description: Lugh desktop session
 The Wayland session of Lugh OS: the lugh-session launcher and its entry in
 /usr/share/wayland-sessions, the Lugh configuration of the Hyprland
 compositor (/usr/share/lugh/hypr: look, animations, rules, keybindings,
 helper scripts), the xdg-desktop-portal backend selection, and the
 Lugh defaults of GTK and foot (/usr/share/lugh/xdg, first in
 XDG_CONFIG_DIRS inside the session) and Chromium (/etc/chromium.d/lugh).
 .
 Title bars for apps that rely on the compositor for them (foot, mpv, Qt,
 X11 apps) come from lugh-hyprbars (recommended).
 .
 Hyprland comes from trixie-backports.
